    "detailed_description": "SlipDream Resonator is a futuristic, multi-directional rhythm game with unique twin-stick analogue controls. Inspired by both classic rhythm games and top-down shooters, SlipDream Resonator offers addictive arcade gameplay designed to challenge while featuring eye catching visuals and a heart pumping soundtrack.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Integration through Simulation</h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1786710/extras/ae95186772b0e9d312482c64866116d9.poster.avif?t=1718030017\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1786710/extras/ae95186772b0e9d312482c64866116d9.webm?t=1718030017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>SlipDream is a state of consciousness that allows a person to dream while being fully awake. As an attempt to create a machine that could induce such a state Advara Therapeutics created SlipDream Resonator. The simulated levels embedded within have been programmed to fully activate the user's mind and body through false stimulus and a direct link to our cloud based neural encoder. The path has been laid before you, embodiment is at your fingertips, integration has already begun.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Potentially endless music based levels</h2><br>SlipDream Resonator features 23 built in levels, each with a unique soundtrack and background visual. <br><br>Players can also create and share their own Custom levels featuring custom music, album art, and background video. Join the Discord community to find a library of user made levels ready for download.<br><br>With 5 difficulty levels SlipDream is accessible to all skill levels while still offering a challenge to the true die-hards.<br><br>Soundtrack featuring music by:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Maxo<br></li><li> Lindsay Lowend<br></li><li> recovery girl &amp; Diana starshine<br></li><li> Splashblade<br></li><li> Varra<br></li><li> Shady Monk<br></li><li> Moistbreezy<br></li><li> Elevation<br></li><li> DeBisco<br></li><li> And more!!!</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Power-ups</h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1786710/extras/b7da6fbd66887793ff389df35b9896e1.poster.avif?t=1718030017\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1786710/extras/b7da6fbd66887793ff389df35b9896e1.webm?t=1718030017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>Power-ups have been dispersed in each simulated level to help aid in difficult moments and encourage breakthroughs. The 4 available power-ups are detailed below.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Atomic</li></ul>Destroys all spawned notes at once. One time use per activation.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Circle</li></ul>Engages every node at once. Useful for sustained notes and breakthrough levels. Three uses per activation<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Time</li></ul>Temporarily slows down time. One time use per activation<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Laser</li></ul>Destroys all spawned notes in a specific lane. Three uses per activation<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Global Leaderboards</h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1786710/extras/a3cd931cf4f966fbc6f2a311cd17346f.poster.avif?t=1718030017\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1786710/extras/a3cd931cf4f966fbc6f2a311cd17346f.webm?t=1718030017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>Check out the Global Leaderboards to see how you stack up against the competition. Global Leaderboards are available for all levels, both built-in and custom.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Free Play</h2><br>Free Play allows the user to customize their experience with a variety of options, including:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Invincibility</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Slow Mo</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Powerup Probability</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Double speed</li></ul><br>&amp; more",
